{"id": "DekHOftx6fx", "title": "Video by adilet.fndr", "description": "Stop signing up for 5 different APIs just to build one tool 🛑\n\nSay you’re vibe coding a small SEO tool. You need Google results, scraping, keyword data, YouTube stats and an AI model. That usually means 5 sign-ups, 5 dashboards, 5 API keys and 5 bills every month.\n\nYepAPI puts all of it behind one key:\n🔎 Real-time Google results (SERP)\n📈 SEO data: keyword volume, difficulty, backlinks\n🕷️ Web scraping, even JS-heavy pages\n▶️ YouTube and Instagram stats\n🤖 130+ AI models through one endpoint\n\nThe best part: you don’t need to understand any of it. Copy their prompt, paste it into Lovable or Claude, and just describe what you want to build. Your AI reads the docs and wires everything up for you.\n\nYou get $5 in free API credits to start, no card needed. After that you only pay per call. No subscriptions, no monthly fees.\n\nComment “YepAPI” and I’ll DM you the link👇 \n\n#ad #vibecoding #api #marketing #claude", "channel": "adilet.fndr", "uploader_id": "26455618998", "uploader": "Adilet", "timestamp": 1792173312, "like_count": 139, "comment_count": 42, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1076394342062568a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.806, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fdac147-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPIK301zsTJJx3Bu07oCZqYiGwjX-acCTrIGtL8bCGeAB0CphxAri24S49akRancdx2xyfYbW7VjH4xKYG0SZRLVfIRkGMeuzOuBfY.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdpEwnk6vRWgnwT4CNBmMIXqGMNText7kMaWL97Qy3VxmN-t49HEiKxerpk2XtLiDjc&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fdac147-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=RpjBhLPi